          <p>Professional SAP training for business and enterprise solutions.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->

  <section class="why-us">

    <div class="container">

      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>

        <p>
          We focus on practical learning, career development, and industry-oriented training.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="features">

        <div class="feature-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop"></i>
          <h4>Live Practical Sessions</h4>
          <p>Hands-on coding and project-based training approach.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i>
          <h4>Trending Technologies</h4>
          <p>Learn AI, Fullstack Development, JavaScript, Python, and more.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
          <h4>Expert Guidance</h4>
          <p>Experienced trainers with professional industry knowledge.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie"></i>
          <h4>Interview Preparation</h4>
          <p>Career guidance and technical interview preparation support.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-certificate"></i>
          <h4>Professional Learning</h4>
          <p>Industry-oriented syllabus with modern development tools.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i>
          <h4>Career Growth</h4>
          <p>Build confidence, skills, and opportunities in the IT field.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- ADDRESS -->

  <section class="address">

    <h2>Visit Our Institute</h2>

    <p>
      Rajmata Complex, 3rd Floor, Above Mannubhai Mithaiwale Shop,
      Kranti Chowk, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar - 431001
    </p>

  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->

  <footer class="footer">

    <h3>VIT Technology Solution</h3>

    <p>
      Empowering Students With Modern Technology Education Since 2013
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top:15px;">
      © 2026 All Rights Reserved | VIT Technology Solution
    </p>
    
  </footer>

</body>
</html>